assistant_text:
Challenge the assumption that **“delivery capacity” rises predictably with headcount**.

It is the model’s most sensitive assumption, yet it is Olumi-authored and currently unvalidated. For a Q3 deadline, test:

- time to recruit, start and reach useful productivity;
- how much senior time junior hires consume in onboarding and review;
- whether the remaining platform work needs senior architectural ownership rather than raw implementation capacity.

Also challenge the user-approved **£0/year current in-scope salary spend** if existing payroll is meant to count toward the £400k cap.
